Private Room in the Povoação - Azores
|Address||Rua Padre João de Medeiros, 9650-403 Povoação, Portugal|
|Property type||Private room|
Price is only for the bedroom, rest of the group will be considered case by case.
My house is located in the town center of Povoação, right next to the hospital, school, church, bank, supermarket, fire, the snack bars and restaurants. There is also a bus stop very close, as well as a tourist information center. The two beaches of Village Povoação are just 500 meters away. The roads on the island have recently been improved so it is very easy to navigate around the island on the basis of the Povoação Council.
It is recommended to rent a car to be able to discover the island of St. Miguel.
House rulesThe main rule of the house is COMMON SENSE.
It is not allowed noise after 22h;
It served breakfast. When not available on my part, preparing breakfast may be responsible (s) of guest (s). As a rule, is served between 7:00 and 8:00 am;
The change of bed linen is made every 7 days;
Bath towels are provided;
It is the responsibility of cleaning the guest room bed and private bathroom;
It is allowed to use the kitchen. Cleaning the kitchen is the responsibility of who to use;
It is allowed to use the barbecue (BBQ) and the yard (garden);
It allowed access to the internet. Wi-Fi available.
